      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Pertaining to the issue involved, there was an earlier writ petition (Fukan Rabha Vs.\nState of Assam) before this Court which was disposed of by an Hon'ble Division Bench in which a land acquisition proceeding was interfered with.",
