      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Since, this Court was connected with that litigation,\nlist this case before any other Bench along with records of the disposed of matter, as the same would have a bearing.",
